  "noteFaces": {
    "note": "The sticky's paper by preset and appearance: the open note, its fanned tab and the All Notes bar all take it; the pill's dash and the swatches keep the light face in both. Text is neutral/950 on the light faces and neutral/0 on the dark ones (Graphite: neutral/0 in both); every pair reads at 5.8:1 or better, markers (neutral/700 light, neutral/100 dark) at 4.5:1 or better. The dark faces keep the light face's hue, deep but saturated. A picked colour (Custom…) is the light face; its dark face is derived (same hue, saturation 45–70 %, lightness stepped down until neutral/0 reads at 5:1) — apps/opennotes/Sources/OpenNotesCore/Note.swift, NotePaper. The first six are 0.1.0's names.",
